# Frontend environment (Stage 9)
#
# ⚠ Everything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the client bundle and is
# PUBLIC by design. Never place API keys, tokens, or any secret here —
# secrets belong in the backend's server-side environment only.

# Optional prefix prepended to every API path. Leave unset for the default
# same-origin deployment, where "/api/*" is routed to the Express API by the
# Vite dev proxy (development) or the nginx proxy (production frontend image).
# Set it ONLY when the SPA is served from a different origin than the API.
# No trailing slash.
#VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
